  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A gas is compressed adiabatically, which one of the following statement is NOT true?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "C5OyZ",
      "text": "There is no heat supplied to the system",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cNBvi",
      "text": "There is no change in the internal energy",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ifpe8",
      "text": "<p>The temperature of the gas increases</p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "bljvK",
      "text": "The change in the internal energy is equal to the work done on the gas",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In&nbsp;adiabatic process,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Using the first&nbsp;law of thermodynamics,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;the&#160;work&#160;done&#160;by&#160;the&#160;gas</mtext><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>so</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>will&#160;be&#160;the&#160;work&#160;done&#160;on&#160;the&#160;gas</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>As the gas is compressed</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
